{"word":"λυσιτελέω-ῶ","uri":"lusiteleô-ô","senses":[{"word":"λυσιτελέω-ῶ","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">λυσιτελέω-ῶ</span></span> [<span class=\"grec-longueur\">ῡῐ</span>] (<span class=\"ital\">impf.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">ἐλυσιτέλεον-ουν</span>) être avantageux, être\nutile : <span class=\"grec\">τινι</span>, <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1, 97 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Mem.</span> <span class=\"refch\">2, 1, 15 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Prot.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">327</span><span class=\"refpb\">b</span>, <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span> à qqn ; <span class=\"ital\">impers.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">λυσιτελεῖ,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Att.</span>\ncela est avantageux ; <span class=\"ital\">avec un inf.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">τεθνάναι λυσιτελεῖ ἢ ζῆν</span>, <span class=\"aut\">And.</span> <span class=\"refch\">16, 28,</span> il vaut mieux\nêtre mort que de vivre ; <span class=\"ital\">ou un dat. et un\ninf. :</span> <span class=\"grec\">μοὶ λυσιτελεῖ ὥσπερ ἔχω\nἔχειν</span>, <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Ap.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">22</span><span class=\"refpb\">e</span>, mieux vaut pour moi être comme je suis ;\n<span class=\"ital\">avec un part. :</span> <span class=\"grec\">οἷς λυσιτελεῖ πειθομένοις</span>, <span class=\"aut\">Lys.</span> <span class=\"refch\">174, 14,</span> ceux à qui il\nest avantageux d’obéir ; <span class=\"ital\">cf.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">1 Alc.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">113</span><span class=\"refpb\">d</span> ; <span class=\"ital\">avec une prop. inf.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hpc.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Fract.</span> <span class=\"refch\">765 ;</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">τὸ λυσιτελοῦν</span>, <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Rsp.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">336</span><span class=\"refpb\">d</s